@ 0 17 0 0e5c3d28405a3ef50a459809261dfdda
+           column  分支
+           column  代码
+           column  消息
+           column  说明
+           row  `Truncated(offset)`  1  _the message ends at offset `offset`, inside a field_  格式错误的消息
+           row  `BadPointer(offset)`  2  _the name pointer at offset `offset` points forward_  格式错误的消息
+           row  `BadLabel(offset, kind)`  3  _the label at offset `offset` has unsupported type `kind`_  格式错误的消息
+           row  `LongLabel(label)`  4  _the label `label` is longer than 63 octets_  错误的名称
+           row  `LongName(name)`  5  _the name `name` is longer than 255 octets_  错误的名称
+           row  `EmptyLabel(text)`  6  _the name `text` contains an empty label_  错误的名称
+           row  `BadEscape(text)`  7  _the name `text` contains a malformed escape sequence_  错误的名称
+           row  `BadRdata(rtype, offset)`  8  _the `rtype` record data at offset `offset` is malformed_  格式错误的消息
+           row  `LongString(length)`  9  _a character-string of `length` octets exceeds 255_  TXT 字符串
+           row  `Trailing(offset)`  10  _the message has trailing bytes from offset `offset`_  格式错误的消息
+           row  `Unresolved(name)`  11  _the name `name` could not be resolved_  来自 `Dns.resolve`
+           row  `Timeout`  12  _no response arrived before the timeout_  由 `coaxial.dns` 等传输层抛出
+           row  `Mismatch(id)`  13  _the response with ID `id` does not answer the query_  由传输层针对 ID 错误的响应抛出

